Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.69,0:00:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.87,0:00:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.21,0:01:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This final playoff match\Nbetween Yugi Motu and Joey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.63,0:01:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler will not only determine\Nwho wins the tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.49,0:01:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but also who wins a match with Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.85,0:01:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Maximillian Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.65,0:01:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to win that match with Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.09,0:01:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to stop him and\Nsave my grandpa. Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.57,0:01:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.63,0:01:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes,\NPegasus must be defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.83,0:01:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to win this, for Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.43,0:01:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping to see you once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.03,0:01:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.94,0:01:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go and win for your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.19,0:01:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would have guessed that out of all the\Nduelists who started in this tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.13,0:01:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,two best friends would\Nwind up in the final match?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.71,0:01:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is definitely harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.35,0:01:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But at least one of them is going\Nto get a chance to take on Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.29,0:01:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.55,0:01:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't you think it'd be easier if\Nthey just flipped a coin or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:02:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we could get our\Nmatch with Pegasus now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that it\Nworks that way, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.07,0:02:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, why doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.19,0:02:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi and Joey are like brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.13,0:02:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They shouldn't be forced to\Nfight each other like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.65,0:02:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally hear what you're saying, but\Nit's just how this tournament works.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.61,0:02:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.23,0:02:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.13,0:02:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope this isn't about you having\Nany second thoughts dueling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.55,0:02:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.46,0:02:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.37,0:02:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Joey, but I\Ndon't know if I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.29,0:02:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, suck it up, Yugi. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.65,0:02:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.83,0:02:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If it came down to us, we'd both just\Nplay our best and most honorable duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.17,0:02:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only way we're\Ngonna really know which one of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.83,0:02:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,us is best prepared to take\Non Pegasus in a final match.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.35,0:02:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.77,0:02:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, maybe Joey is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.63,0:02:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not want to do this, but still, it\Nhas to be done if we want to beat Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.07,0:02:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.61,0:03:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.37,0:03:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.01,0:03:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your gracious host will now make\Na few opening remarks. Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.99,0:03:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the finest in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.61,0:03:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And for that reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.63,0:03:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to a match that's\Nsure to consist of your dueling best.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, should you give me\Nanything less, I will know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.01,0:03:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, before we start, I\Njust want to say thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.41,0:03:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in the final match of the biggest Duel
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.67,0:03:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsters Tournament\Nthat's ever been thrown.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.31,0:03:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's all because of you, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.15,0:03:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You got me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.33,0:03:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You looked out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.93,0:04:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.21,0:04:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You earned your place here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.83,0:04:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.74,0:04:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just know that no matter what\Nhappens here, you're my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.47,0:04:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And you always will be, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't think that means I'm\Ngoing to go easy on you in this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.07,0:04:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,or that I expect you to go easy on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.57,0:04:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.07,0:04:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think Pegasus\Nhas to worry much about
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.57,0:04:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,these two not dueling their very hardest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.79,0:04:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,With what's on the line here,\Nthey're both sure to go all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.83,0:04:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.31,0:04:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The same best friends\Nwho would do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to help each other have\Nnow become arch-rivals,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.59,0:04:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,bitted against each other in a desperate\Nmatch that can boast but a single
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,winner what a splendid show this\Nshould make all right joey you asked
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.59,0:04:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,for my best and i intend to give it\Nyugi i won't insult you by giving you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.11,0:04:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,anything less than my all i'm gonna\Ncome at you hard right from the start
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.05,0:05:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,how to come to this after all\Nwe've been through two of a pair
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.21,0:05:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now on opposite sides from the\Nvery start. With honor we'd do,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,washed each other's back,\Nand we battled with pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.13,0:05:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We are closer than brothers,\Nnow we have to fight each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.85,0:05:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and the trust of faith to\Nthe heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, let the game begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.77,0:05:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, we're\Nthe best man waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.17,0:05:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, we're in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, we'll be friends forever
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.95,0:05:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, it's been you and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.31,0:05:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanging out playing\Ngames. Didn't ever think
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.95,0:05:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It would get this hard.\NTime's running out,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.61,0:05:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's so much at stake\NEverything riding on the turn of a card
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.25,0:06:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll show them what we're made of,\Nas we fight for the ones we love.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.29,0:06:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll be friends till the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the match begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.87,0:06:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.25,0:06:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.61,0:06:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll throw this in attack\Nmode. Bring it! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.63,0:06:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Celtic Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.71,0:06:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.62,0:06:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,it was one thing when Joey\Nand Yugi had duels back
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.15,0:06:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,home and there wasn't\Nanything big on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.85,0:06:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But here...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is at stake. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.83,0:06:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The money for Serenity's operation, the\Nmatch that could save Yugi's grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.15,0:06:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.41,0:06:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish they could both win.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.45,0:06:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The stakes are high,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.89,0:06:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but hopefully after\Neverything's said and done,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.89,0:06:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,there'll be a way for both of them\Nto get what they fought so hard for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wishful thinking, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But after everything's said and done,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.95,0:07:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the only one to get what I\Nwant, including what I want from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.53,0:07:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Joey, it's your turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.41,0:07:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you asked for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm throwing Guilty of\Nthe Night in Attack Mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that for starters?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Guilty, huh? Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.91,0:07:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul Spear Assault!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.47,0:07:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Celtic guardian's been creamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.91,0:07:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to pull any\Npunches in this here duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's really not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.43,0:07:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.53,0:07:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.93,0:07:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, though, Tristan,\Nthere's a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.73,0:07:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone can score an early lead in a duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.19,0:07:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but only a few can play\Nwell for the entire match.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.51,0:07:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly right, Taya. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.85,0:08:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Tristan, even\Nthough Yugi's behind in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.53,0:08:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,points now he's proven himself\Nable to stay focused and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.71,0:08:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,make the big plays when they\Ncount not that Joey hasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.63,0:08:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,shown the same promise it's\Njust that Yugi's had more
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.09,0:08:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,experience and that may be\Nwhat gives him the edge here
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.91,0:08:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey left his knight on the field completely\Nunprotected just one of those amateur
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.95,0:08:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,mistakes could cost him the match if he\Nwere dueling Pegasus what is he thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.29,0:08:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,timeout Joey timeout ever since we arrived\Non this island I've done my very best to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.15,0:08:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach you everything that I know. Now you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.91,0:08:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,must put everything\Nyou've learned into play
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.63,0:08:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,think strategically you cannot afford\Nany mistakes mistakes i don't get it what
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.85,0:08:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,are you saying you that i did something\Nwrong already it's only been one turn so far
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.33,0:08:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,what i'm saying joey is that in a duel of\Nthis magnitude every single move you make
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,is crucial one false card and it can cost\Nyou everything you've worked so hard for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.57,0:08:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.53,0:09:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Every move I make here has\Ngot to be right on the dot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.47,0:09:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, because here no\None lets a mistake go unpunished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.91,0:09:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Pegasus and not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.67,0:09:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, time in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.49,0:09:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now give me your best shot, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I intend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.17,0:09:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Gaia the Fierce Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Guilty of the night is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.97,0:09:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure took it to me\Nthere, Ugg. Good move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.25,0:09:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see what old\NJoey can come up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There, Armored Lizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,In defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.69,0:09:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Joey has a better\Nmonster than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.79,0:09:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I wonder what he's planning here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.13,0:09:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he playing that throwaway\Nmonster for? Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.51,0:09:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps Joey hasn't learned\Nas much as we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.85,0:10:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yugi, it's your turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.93,0:10:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll play this, the\NSummoned Skull in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.25,0:10:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.67,0:10:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Armored lizard is vanquished
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at Joey. He almost looks\Nglad his creature was struck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.31,0:10:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, that's sad. He's\Nin denial already. No,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.87,0:10:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,that's not what I meant I think that\NJoey played that mediocre monster of his
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.35,0:10:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So Yugi would be lulled into a false\Nsense of security and attack it After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.71,0:10:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey knows full well\Nthat Yugi has monsters in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.03,0:10:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,his deck that could easily\Nbeat his armored lizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I think that Joey was just\Ntrying to draw Yugi's monster out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.63,0:10:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.67,0:10:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was hoping you were gonna\Nthrow down that Summoned Skull card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.91,0:10:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I needed him out for my strategy to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.45,0:11:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A strategy that has zero\Nmistakes, I might add.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.25,0:11:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But here, you don't have to\Njust take my word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.35,0:11:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready, bud, because now it's\Nmy turn to teach you a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.05,0:11:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey sure seems confident\Nthat whatever he has
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.71,0:11:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,planned will take down\NYu-Gi's summoned skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.99,0:11:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play this first in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The flame swordsman?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.13,0:11:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why play him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The swordsman won't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The Summoned Skull's\Nattack power is too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.09,0:11:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Not once Joey plays that. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.59,0:11:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate doing this to you, but I'm playing\Nthe Magical Shield and Sword card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.37,0:11:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.57,0:11:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're in for it, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.09,0:12:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic of the Shield\Nand Sword card flips each
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.31,0:12:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,monster's attack points\Nwith their defense points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.45,0:12:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's Swordsman will have more attack\Npoints than Yugi's Summoned Skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.15,0:12:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Clever move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.91,0:12:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So how's that for putting every slick move\Nthat I've learned here into play, Uke?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.01,0:12:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you wish you didn't show me the\Nropes quite so well now, huh, bud?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.15,0:12:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.06,0:12:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Flaming sword of battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.47,0:12:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon skull's been reduced\Nto ash. Well played, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.87,0:12:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You not only reduced my life points, but\Nyou took out one of my best monsters, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.29,0:12:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, pal,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.31,0:12:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's nothing compared to some of the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.01,0:12:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,other moves I got ready\Nto bust out in this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And I look forward to them, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.39,0:12:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But remember, you're not the only one\Nwith powerful moves ready to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.99,0:12:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, bring them on, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.07,0:12:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is really heating up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.11,0:13:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and with the level of\Nskill that those two possess,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.19,0:13:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a strong feeling that things are\Nonly going to get hotter down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The passion, the drama, the ferocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends make such wonderful adversaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.73,0:13:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's see one of them moves, Uke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.41,0:13:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.87,0:13:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Summoned Skull will now be avenged.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.57,0:13:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.57,0:13:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're gonna have to get\Nthrough my flame swordsman first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.37,0:13:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.28,0:13:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse of Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.27,0:13:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.71,0:13:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And next,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.05,0:13:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use this polymerization card to fuse\Nmy dragon with Gaia, the Fierce Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.17,0:13:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, Gaia the Dragon Champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.49,0:14:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my dragon champion, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.15,0:14:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your swordsman's been trounced.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.51,0:14:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.85,0:14:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.76,0:14:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.83,0:14:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.39,0:14:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi keeps a laser-like focus and makes\Nthe big plays when they really count.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I guess we'll see\Nif Joey can do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How can Joey make a big play with\Nthat dragon champion out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.45,0:14:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not about what's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.57,0:14:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, just as Yugi was able to keep his\Ncool while facing that flame swordsman,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.81,0:14:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,now Joey needs to maintain his focus,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,even while he's being\Nattacked by his best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.65,0:14:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's being forced to think on his feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.97,0:14:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it's as if Yugi and Joey are\Npushing each other to duel their very best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.79,0:14:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.23,0:14:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They're pushing each other\Nas hard as they can now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.75,0:15:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,so that no matter which\None of them wins this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.49,0:15:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll be at his best\Nwhen he faces Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.39,0:15:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I'm the only one\Nwho appreciates watching two
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.21,0:15:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,friends push each other to\Nthe brink of their abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.95,0:15:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's something\Nof an acquired taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.59,0:15:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So even though they're being\Nforced to fight against each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.05,0:15:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,they've actually found a way to\Nhelp each other. It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.83,0:15:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.29,0:15:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.20,0:15:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.13,0:15:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fail me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.93,0:15:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Copycat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.69,0:15:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.81,0:15:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the Grave Robber, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I could use\Nthese two in a way that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,it'd be able to take out\NYugi's Dragon Champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.29,0:15:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe even clinch the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.43,0:15:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.95,0:15:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready or not, here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.59,0:15:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this combo of\Nmine might actually work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.91,0:16:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What could Joey be smiling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.37,0:16:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaia the Dragon Champion is\None of my toughest monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.54,0:16:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Dragon Champ's done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.81,0:16:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He's done for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.51,0:16:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey must have something big planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'm summoning the Red-Eyes\NBlack Dragon in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll add Grave Robber to steal\Na monster from your graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.37,0:16:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My skull?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.93,0:16:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.71,0:16:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.63,0:16:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.97,0:16:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, I think I'll throw down\Nthis little critter right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.65,0:16:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out the copycat cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.11,0:16:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can copy any card\Nyou have on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.29,0:16:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know just which one I want, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.63,0:17:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The powerful, mystical,\Nmagical polymerization.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.37,0:17:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My fusion card. Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.61,0:17:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I may have never played it before, but\NI've seen you use it plenty of times. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.33,0:17:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Red-Eyes, Black Dragon, and Summon\NSkull, combine yourselves into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.81,0:17:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out, the Black\NSkull Dragon. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.39,0:17:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Superb, two-fused duel\Nmonsters set for battle, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.65,0:17:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.95,0:17:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure you know what's coming\Nnext, so you better brace yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.45,0:17:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Black Skull Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack the Dragon Champion now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.27,0:17:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Molten Fireball!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.45,0:18:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I actually did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.77,0:18:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I just took down one of the most\Npowerful monsters in your whole deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.21,0:18:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I just beat your Dragon Champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.79,0:18:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.11,0:18:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, that was a pretty\Nsweet move I played,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.61,0:18:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,with the whole\Npolymerization thing and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.55,0:18:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.63,0:18:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You got your game face on to try\Nand keep me in suspense, huh, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.77,0:18:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.01,0:18:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just letting you enjoy your triumph.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.49,0:18:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You played a fine move, and\Nnow allow me to play mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.69,0:18:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.87,0:18:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this duel's heating up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, did you see that\Nlook in Yugi's eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.99,0:18:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That stare's meant doom for many\Na duelist at the same time. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.99,0:18:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey seems to be almost\Nunstoppable right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.09,0:18:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's truly anyone's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.63,0:19:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi. Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.87,0:19:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.78,0:19:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I so look forward to seeing\Nhow this will turn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.51,0:19:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.65,0:19:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Because my Black Skull Dragon's\Nabout to end this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.47,0:19:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.38,0:19:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's just getting started.
